-spacing: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">26</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) 15</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">시까지</span></b><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">발표안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">합격자에게만 개별 문자발송</span><br><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지급안내 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장학생 개인 명의 계좌 입금</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지원자격 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">각 항에 해당되는 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">복지 장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">경제사정이 어려운 자&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">기초생활 수급자 증명원 첨부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 2) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">공로 장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">동창회 및 학생회 활동에 공로가 많은 자</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">기타 장학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">편입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대학원생 제외</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청서 교부처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학교 홈페이지 공고 파일 다운받아 작성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">8.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">접수처 및 문의처 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">총동창회 사무실 직접 방문접수</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">방문전 연락바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 주소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">구미시 구미대로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">350-27.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신평 금오공과대학교 평생교육원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">층 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">211</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">호</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;( T. 054-478-6800 )</span><br><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">9. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청절차</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">● </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장학금 신청서 수령 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장학금 신청서 작성</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">추천서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">본인소견서 작성 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">총동창회 사무국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">서류심사&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 4pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">● </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청서류 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">재학증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">성적증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전학년 성정증명서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">).</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장학금신청서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">추천서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">교수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">).</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">본인소견서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"10580\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"12, 0, 0, 4637\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_10\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2026-10-23T01:48:27.625Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\":